# {REPO_NAME}

Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). It is the entry file for this repository and the only
routing document.

This file exists because some agents look for `CLAUDE.md` first. It is a pointer,
not a second copy. If you find yourself adding content here, it belongs in
